    "title": "Employees of bus company servicing multiple Connecticut school districts vote to authorize strike - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By William Gonzalez ,\n4 hours ago WASHINGTON (WTNH) — Unionized employees at First Student, the country’s largest private school bus company which services multiple Connecticut school districts, have voted by an 88% margin to authorize a strike, should the company and the union members fail to agree on a new contract by the end of the month. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
